(
  '66666666-6666-4666-8666-666666666666',
  'local_page',
  'turkish-catering-and-group-dining',
  'Turkish Catering and Group Dining in San Francisco',
  'Plan a San Francisco gathering with shareable Turkish and Mediterranean dishes, catering options and group dining at Turquaz.',
  '[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Food for a group should be generous, easy to share and suited to the occasion. Turquaz offers Turkish and Mediterranean flavors for office meals, family celebrations, community gatherings and other San Francisco events."},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Build a shareable Turkish menu"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Meze, salads, rice or bulgur, breads, grilled meats, vegetable dishes and pastries can be combined into a varied spread. A shared format lets guests explore several flavors and makes the meal feel connected rather than individually packaged."},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Plan for your group"},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"items":["Estimate the guest count and serving time","Share dietary needs and ingredient questions","Choose pickup, delivery or an in-restaurant meal","Confirm serving equipment and setup needs","Place the order with enough preparation time"]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Office lunches and team meals"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"For workplace gatherings, bowls, salads, meze, breads and grilled plates can create a flexible lunch with familiar and new flavors. Confirm the final menu, quantities and fulfillment details with the restaurant or the linked catering platform."},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Family celebrations and social gatherings"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A Turkish table naturally supports conversation and sharing. A sequence of meze, warm dishes, grilled selections and dessert can suit birthdays, reunions and informal celebrations. Contact Turquaz early when the group is large or the timing is fixed."},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Start your catering request"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Turquaz provides online catering options and direct contact for custom requests. Tell us the date, approximate guest count, preferred service time and any dietary questions so the team can guide you toward current choices."}]',
  'published',
  'Turkish Catering San Francisco | Turquaz',
  'Explore Turkish and Mediterranean catering and group dining in San Francisco from Turquaz. Plan office meals, celebrations and events.',
